{"title":"북검전기 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=c7vWH/dJMcahKpmwv/CkatxoIxi5tiiuurPAdtsk&filename=th3","synopsis":"북방에서 홀로 새외를 막는 고독하고도 위대한 방패, 북천문.\n하지만 북천문의 희생에 평화를 얻은 운중천은 그들을 토사구팽했다.\n\n북천문주의 아들 진무원은 살아남기 위해 바보가 되었다.\n무공도 익히지 못하는 유약한 호부견자가 되었다.\n하지만......\n북천문의 후예는 결코 굴종하지 않는다.\n\n북방의 거친 바람 속에 홀로 선 소년, 진무원. 그의 칼끝이 마침내 세상을 향해 겨누어진다!","topComments":[{"author":"프로필명 김태현","date":"댓글 작성 일자 26.05.06","text":"댓글 내용 와! 이거 진짜 재밌네요.. 제가 본 어떤 그 무협소설보다 재밌네요!","episode":"회차 정보 북검전기 7권","likeCount":"좋아요","replyCount":"댓글 달기"}],"commentKeywords":[{"word":"재밌네요","count":2}],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":249,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":266,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":281,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":288,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":252,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":253,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":283,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":267,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":264,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":230,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":259,"change":{"type":"down","amount":29}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":30183,"rc":14,"rs":117,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":30230,"rc":14,"rs":117,"cc":1},{"date":"2026-10-09